ent returns schema-validated JSON, rendered compactly for the next[5C[1B[38;5;77m    +[38;5;231m stage. No raw text dumps, no truncation.                                                              [6C[1B[38;5;77m59[11G[38;5;231m-[13G**Severity-gated loop** — only `cri[49Gical` and `major` issu[72Gs trigg[80Gr [84Gothe[89G Code pass. Minor finding[5C[1B[38;5;77m    +[38;5;231ms ride along in the final report instead of burning an iteration.                                      [5C[1B[38;5;77m 60 +[38;5;231m- **Prompts live in agents** — the workflow passes a one-line task; the agent definition carries the fu[5C[1B[38;5;77m    +[38;5;231mll instructions. Keeps the orchestrator readable and the prompts editable in one place.                [5C[1B[49m[2m 61 [22m - **Budget-aware Docs** — the Docs phase is skipped if the remaining token budget drops below a configu[2C[1B[39m   [38;5;231m[2m    [22m rable floor. It's non-blocking.[5C[1B[2m 62 [22m [1B[39m [3G   [38;5;231m[2m 63 [22m ## Model routing[39m[40;1H[38;3H[?25h[?25l[H[6G[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 40 +[38;5;231m| Explore | [48;5;28mexplorer[48;5;22m | (Opt-in) Fan-out search for task-specific [48;5;28mfiles[48;5;22m, call sites[48;5;28m,[48;5;22m [48;5;28mtricky spots [48;5;22m|     [49m[39m[40;1H[38;3H[?25h[?25l[H[33B[38;5;174m✽[3G[38;5;180mMetamorphosing…[39m[40;1H[38;3H[?25h]0;⠂ Claude Code]0;⠐ Claude Code]0;⠂ Claude Code]0;⠐ Claude Code]0;⠂ Claude Code]0;⠐ Claude Code[?25l[H[2C[33B[38;5;174mMetamorphosing…[20G[38;5;246m6[23G4s · ↓[39m [38;5;246m24.8k tokens)[39m[K[40;1H[38;3H[?25h[?25l[H[33B[38;5;174m✻[39m[40;1H[38;3H[?25h[?25l[H[33B[38;5;174m✶[39m[40;1H[38;3H[?25h[?25l[H[33B[38;5;174m*[23G[38;5;246m5[39m[40;1H[38;3H[?25h]0;⠂ Claude Code[?25l[H[33B[38;5;174m✢[39m[40;1H[38;3H[?25h[?25l[H[33B[38;5;174m·[39m[40;1H[38;3H[?25h[?25l[H[33B[38;5;174m✢[3