takes[76Gjustify[84Git:[5C[1B[38;5;77m 26 +[38;5;231m                                                                                                       [5C[1B[38;5;77m 27 +[38;5;231m```                                                                                                    [5C[1B[38;5;77m 28 +[38;5;231m/deep-research "which message queue fits a 50k-events/sec pipeline with exactly-once delivery"         [5C[1B[38;5;77m 29 +[38;5;231m```                                                                                                    [2C[1B[49m[39m   [38;5;77m[48;5;22m 30 +[38;5;231m                                                                                                       [5C[1B[38;5;77m 31 +[38;5;231mIt fans out across several search angles in parallel, has independent agents **vote** on each claim, th[1B[49m[39m [3G  [6G[38;5;77m[48;5;22m    +[38;5;231men **adversarially verifies** — separate agents try to refute what survived. Claims that don't hold up [5C[1B[38;5;77m    +[38;5;231mare dropped before the report is written.                                                              [1B[49m[39m [3G   [38;5;77m[48;5;22m 32 +[38;5;231m                                                                                                       [1B[49m[39m     [38;5;77m[48;5;22m 33 +[38;5;231mThe difference that matters: this agent rates its own confidence, and self-assessment is weak by nature[5C[1B[38;5;77m    +[38;5;231m — the same reasoning that produced a claim also judges it. Independent voting and adversarial refutati[5C[1B[38;5;77m    +[38;5;231mon are external checks, and they catch a class of error a single pass cannot.                          [5C[1B[38;5;77m 34 +[38;5;231m                                                                                                       [6C[1B[38;5;77m35[11G[38;5;231mPrefer `/deep-research`[35Gwhen:[5C[1B[38;5;