64G      [71G   [75G     [81G    [86G          [97G    [102G        [111G  [6C[1B[38;5;77m52[11G[38;5;231m   [15G        [24G      [31G    [36G   [40G  [43G   [47G   [51G       [59G       [67G    [72G      [79G   [83G           [95G  [98G       [106G [108G    [113G [5C[1B[49m[2m 53 [22m ### 6. Review your own diff[39m[K[5C[1B[38;5;231m[2m 54 [22m [39m[K[7C[1B[38;5;231m[2m5[11G[22m`git diff` before finish[36Gng. Look for stray debug output, unrelated edits, missing imports.[5C[1B[39m[K[1B[38;5;231m●[3G[39mОбновляю README — новая команда в таблицу и объяснение механизма.[K[2B[38;5;114m●[3G[39m[1mUpdate[22m(README.md)[21G[K[1B[38;5;246m  ⎿  [39mAdded[12G[1m1[14G[22mline[1B [3G   [38;5;231m[2m 156 [22m | `/ldo-reviewer` | Review the diff, drive the app, try to break it |[1B[39m     [38;5;231m[2m 157 [22m | `/ldo-security` | Threat-model a plan |[8C[1B[2m8[22G[22msearcher "top[36Gc"` | Multi-sourc[55Gweb[59Gresearch[68G|[39m[K[5C[1B[38;5;77m[48;5;22m 159 +[38;5;231m| `/ldo-docs-audit` | Read the docs cold and find what's drifted |                                    [7C[1B[49m[2m60[20G[22mconfig` | Walk through model routing |[39m[K[5C[1B[38;5;231m[2m 161 [22m | `/ldo-init` | Write the self-routing block into the project's `CLAUDE.md` |[39m[K[8C[1B[38;5;231m[2m2[20G[22magent-ux`[30G| Wri[36Ge agent context and output that a model and a human can both read |[5C[1B[39m[K[1B[38;5;246m [3G[39mSearching for [1m1[22m pattern…[K[2B[38;5;246m●[3G[39m[1mUpdate[22m(README.md)[K[40;1H[35;3H[?25h[?25l[H[6G[38;5;231m[2m 47 [22m Internal refactors get no doc changes. Don't rewrite whole documents; touch the relevant sections. If t[26B[39m [3G[38;5;246mSearched for [1m1[22m pattern [39m[K[4B[38;5;174m*[5Gink[39m[40;1H[35;3H[?25h[?25l[H[30B[38;5;174m✢[39m[40;1H[35;3H[?25h[?25l[H[101C[39B[38